    "title": "Reno Little Theater opens Margaret Atwood's 'The Penelopiad' - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Jayde Ryan Katey Roshetko ,\n1 days ago RENO, Nev. (KOLO) - Reno Little Theater is bringing a contemporary feminist perspective to ancient Greek mythology with its latest production, “The Penelopiad,” opening this weekend. Written by acclaimed author Margaret Atwood and directed by Libby Bakke, the production runs through mid-October. The play retells Homer’s classic epic... Read full article\n3",
